        "text_block": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>The Ultra-Processed Trap</h3><p>When mass-market manufacturers remove gluten, eggs, or dairy, they typically substitute them with ultra-processed fillers: modified starches, maltodextrins, xanthan gum, synthetic emulsifiers, and artificial preservatives.</p><p>Today, over <strong>54% of daily calorie intake in the UK</strong> comes from ultra-processed food (UPF). The global 2024 British Medical Journal review of almost 10 million participants linked high UPF consumption directly to 32 damaging health outcomes.</p><p>We adhere rigorously to the <strong>NOVA Category 1–3 framework</strong>. Our sauces contain real vine tomatoes, whole cider vinegar, raw honey, fermented chillies, garlic, ginger, and freshly ground spices. No industrial texturisers. No chemical stabilizers. Real food, period.</p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
        }
